- **D-8 The database's wake (BEFORE PART D).** UAT is on the free offer: it pauses after a fixed 15 minutes idle (online spells min 15, median 20, max 61 min; ARM resume 30 or 60 s; first `/health/ready` after a pause 50.91-65.05 s; `B991_STATUS.md:139,144,163`). `/health` (API) and `/api/health` (web) are used by the poller; `/health/ready` touches SQL and wakes it (`infra/README.md:118,129`): use it only where this brief says.
